{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-areaguide-detail-template-js","path":"/area-guides/Al-Fahid-Island/","result":{"data":{"strapiAreaGuide":{"id":"8873be67-9d7b-548d-bc7f-d5eb2d8c56cf","description":{"data":{"description":"<p>A new era of serene, sustainable island living<br>&nbsp;</p>"}},"video_ask_url":null,"amenities":null,"title":"Al Fahid Island","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Al_Fahid_Island_Abu_Dhabi_Area_Guide_4e3a165586.jpg"},"masterplan_image":null,"sponsored_projects":[],"teams":[],"strapi_id":245,"slug":"Al-Fahid-Island","custom_property_slug":null,"publish":true,"more_info":[{"strapi_id":7188,"question":"Community Overview","id":"bdfc2279-a921-515b-a2eb-4a47a345c54f","answer":{"data":{"answer":"<p>The Al Fahid Island location is ideal for those seeking a harmonious blend of luxury and nature. Situated in the heart of Abu Dhabi's northern waterfront corridor, the island offers a master-planned lifestyle that emphasizes privacy, sustainability, and premium amenities.</p><p>The island also holds the distinction of being the first island globally to earn a Fitwel 3-star certification, alongside pre-certification for LEED Platinum and Estidama 3 Pearl, underscoring its global leadership in sustainable urban development.</p><p>Residential options will range from waterfront apartments to ultra-luxury beach and mangrove villas, all within thoughtfully landscaped neighborhoods. With dedicated green spaces ensuring no home is more than 250 meters from a park, the community is tailored for wellness and family-friendly living. As the island evolves, it is expected to become a leading example of beachfront urbanism in the UAE.</p><p><img src=\"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Community_Overview_48316049be.jpg\" alt=\"Community Overview\"></p>","id":"48c5a237-a470-5d60-931c-b1d9b7427a0b"}}},{"strapi_id":7189,"question":"Property Insights","id":"61dba3b0-496a-5c1f-968c-71c2dd8edefb","answer":{"data":{"answer":"<p>Fahid Island is envisioned as a luxurious residential enclave with a focus on sustainability and exclusivity. Aldar Properties plans to develop over 4,000 to 6,000 residential units, including apartments, townhouses, and high-end villas. The property types are designed to cater to a diverse set of homeowners, from young professionals to large families, all looking to experience elevated living on the Abu Dhabi coastline.</p><p><img src=\"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Property_Insights_aa771a023c.jpg\" alt=\"Property Insights\"></p><h3>Popular Buildings in Fahid Island</h3><p>While full-scale development is still underway, Fahid Island is expected to feature signature residential clusters and private gated communities, each designed with modern architecture and views of either the beach or mangrove reserves. Aldar is likely to release flagship buildings offering top-tier amenities and beachfront access.</p><h3>Renting a Property in Fahid Island</h3><p>Currently in the development phase, renting a property in Fahid Island is not yet available. However, future rental options are expected to range from compact, high-spec apartments to sprawling villas.</p><h3>Buying a Property in Fahid Island</h3><p>For buyers seeking beachfront living in Abu Dhabi, Fahid Island presents a unique opportunity. Properties will feature cutting-edge design, energy-efficient features, and access to a host of lifestyle amenities. Buyers can choose from waterfront apartments or bespoke villas with private beach or mangrove access.</p>","id":"e6c461cd-fe6b-54ff-890f-dd5d4b18d60c"}}},{"strapi_id":7190,"question":"What’s Life Like in Fahid Island, Abu Dhabi?","id":"8e4e8143-bad6-56fb-882e-e2fbb0f07b12","answer":{"data":{"answer":"<p>Life on Fahid Island Abu Dhabi is envisioned as tranquil, luxurious, and nature-centric. With a focus on outdoor living, wellness, and community engagement, the island offers green parks, walkways, and access to beach clubs. It promises a high quality of life within a protected and well-designed environment.</p><h3>Transportation and Parking Spaces in Fahid Island&nbsp;</h3><p>As a modern development, Fahid Island will have ample parking spaces and transportation links.<br>Road networks are already established via the E12 highway, with internal roads and pedestrian-friendly pathways integrated into the master plan. Residents can expect private garages, communal parking areas, and potentially electric vehicle charging stations.</p><h3>Supermarkets in and Around Fahid Island</h3><p>Major supermarkets and convenience stores are expected to be part of the retail zone planned on Fahid Island. Until then, residents will rely on nearby facilities on Yas Island and Saadiyat Island, which already host well-known supermarket chains.</p><h3>Shopping Mall in and Near Fahid Island</h3><p>Fahid Island residents will benefit from proximity to Yas Mall and boutique retail experiences on Saadiyat Island. Future plans may include community shopping areas and waterfront retail promenades on the island itself.</p><p><img src=\"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Shopping_Mall_in_and_Near_Fahid_Island_6cb2ea3166.jpg\" alt=\"Shopping Mall in and Near Fahid Island\"></p><h3>Location &amp; Nearby Areas</h3><p>Located strategically between Yas and Saadiyat Islands, Fahid Island is near Abu Dhabi’s cultural, leisure, and commercial hubs. Its close proximity to Yas Island, Saadiyat Island, Zayed International Airport, and Downtown Abu Dhabi.</p>","id":"647d8e14-3948-5b76-97a3-3003850a1c57"}}},{"strapi_id":7191,"question":"Things to Do in Fahid Island, Abu Dhabi","id":"4d4e5002-d603-585d-bdb1-b5cf0c66eb72","answer":{"data":{"answer":"<p>Nature trails, beach walks, and water sports will be central to life on Fahid Island. A 3 km mangrove boardwalk and extensive green areas will offer residents opportunities for relaxation and exploration in a natural setting.</p><h3>Beaches Near Fahid Island</h3><p>Private beaches on the island will be a key attraction, but residents can also explore nearby public beaches such as Yas Beach and Saadiyat Public Beach.</p><p><img src=\"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Beaches_Near_Fahid_Island_2c581373e5.jpg\" alt=\"Beaches Near Fahid Island\"></p><h3>Hotels in and Around Fahid Island</h3><p>While hotels are planned for Fahid Island in later phases, nearby options include luxury stays on Yas and Saadiyat Islands like St. Regis Saadiyat and W Abu Dhabi.</p><h3>Outdoor Activities, Fitness and Beauty</h3><p>Fahid Island sets a new benchmark for active, sustainable living in Abu Dhabi, with 940,000 sq m of lush green spaces, expansive parks, and shaded walking trails.</p><p>Every residence will be within 250 meters of a park, ensuring convenient access to nature. The development provides 7.5 acres of open space per 1,000 residents—well above international urban wellness standards. The island is ringed by a 10 km protective berm, designed to safeguard its natural coastline while supporting recreational use.</p><p>A 3 km mangrove boardwalk, berm park, extensive cycling tracks, and a scenic waterfront promenade further enrich the outdoor experience. These facilities cater to wellness, fitness, and leisure year-round.</p><h3>Community Events</h3><p>In time, Fahid Island is expected to host exclusive community events such as wellness festivals, beach cleanups, cultural performances, and resident gatherings that foster a strong sense of belonging.</p><h3>Attractions and Landmarks</h3><p>Nearby landmarks include world-class attractions like the Louvre Abu Dhabi, Ferrari World, Yas Marina Circuit, and Manarat Al Saadiyat, all within a short drive from Fahid Island.</p>","id":"133046a0-f83e-55f7-85da-bb62bce6112a"}}},{"strapi_id":7192,"question":"Things to Consider","id":"4959ca1c-2e9e-50f6-8b04-0dd830c9a4db","answer":{"data":{"answer":"<p>Fahid Island is still under development, which may limit immediate occupancy or services. However, its long-term potential as a premium coastal address makes it a strong prospect for buyers and investors.</p>","id":"b99fe589-13c0-5d3d-b30a-9d99d5025ce8"}}},{"strapi_id":7193,"question":"FAQs About Fahid Island","id":"1c122924-3d52-5e57-9971-b60f0f95fe4d","answer":{"data":{"answer":"<h3>When will properties be available on Fahid Island?</h3><p>Sales are expected to open by late 2025, with phased handovers thereafter.</p><h3>Is Fahid Island suitable for families?</h3><p>Yes. The island is designed with parks, schools, and family-friendly amenities.</p><h3>Can foreigners buy property here?</h3><p>Yes, Fahid Island is part of Abu Dhabi’s freehold zones open to expatriate investors.</p><h3>How does Fahid Island contribute to Abu Dhabi’s overall urban planning goals?</h3><p>Fahid Island aligns with Abu Dhabi’s Vision 2030 by promoting sustainable development, enhancing coastal tourism, and expanding residential zones that support long-term livability and economic growth.</p><h3>Are there plans for technological infrastructure or smart city features?</h3><p>Yes, Aldar is expected to integrate smart infrastructure such as energy-efficient systems, high-speed connectivity, and community management platforms to enhance quality of life and operational efficiency.</p>","id":"f7b1c1a8-30d4-55af-99c2-a71b79e3c6a4"}}},{"strapi_id":7194,"question":"Map","id":"0d9f930a-6789-52e4-add4-2fc7a4705259","answer":{"data":{"answer":"<p>This map highlights Fahid Island’s prime coastal location within Abu Dhabi’s northern urban expansion zone.</p><p><img src=\"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Map_a2ef344541.jpg\" alt=\"Map\"></p>","id":"f27c14f9-1d14-5f75-956a-cd799fdf4f14"}}}],"longitude":54.555663,"latitude":24.509265,"content":{"data":{"content":"<p>Nestled between Yas Island and Saadiyat Island, Fahid Island Abu Dhabi is emerging as one of the capital’s most prestigious waterfront communities. Known for its pristine white-sand beaches and turquoise waters, this natural island spans over 3.4 million square meters, offering a rare blend of ecological richness and upscale development. <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-aldar-properties/\">Aldar Properties</a> acquired the island in January 2023 as part of its strategic expansion into Abu Dhabi's prime coastal corridor</p><p>One of the most compelling aspects of Al Fahid Island is its natural landscape. With over 11 km of coastline, 4.6 km of beachfront, and extensive mangrove forests, the island is being developed to preserve its environmental heritage. Aldar's master plan incorporates sustainable building practices, including a 3 km mangrove boardwalk and a 10 km protective berm to safeguard coastal habitats. These initiatives make Al Fahid Island one of Abu Dhabi's most eco-conscious residential destinations.</p><p>Set within close proximity to major urban hubs, Al Fahid Island Abu Dhabi is easily accessible via the Sheikh Khalifa bin Zayed Highway (E12). This connectivity places residents minutes from Yas Island's entertainment zones, Saadiyat Island's cultural landmarks, and Abu Dhabi International Airport. With a vision to host up to 6,000 high-end residences along with schools, retail outlets, a marina, and hospitality options, the island is designed to be both exclusive and well-integrated into Abu Dhabi's expanding coastal corridor.</p>"}},"ggfx_results":[{"src_cftle":"i/Al_Fahid_Island_Abu_Dhabi_Area_Guide_Provident_Estate_348c12ee44.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/340x212/Al_Fahid_Island_Abu_Dhabi_Area_Guide_Provident_Estate_348c12ee44.webp","transform":"340x212","format":"webp"}]},{"src_cftle":"i/Al_Fahid_Island_Abu_Dhabi_Area_Guide_Provident_Estate_ac5105f2db.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/1773x/Al_Fahid_Island_Abu_Dhabi_Area_Guide_Provident_Estate_ac5105f2db.webp","transform":"1773x","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/744x/Al_Fahid_Island_Abu_Dhabi_Area_Guide_Provident_Estate_ac5105f2db.webp","transform":"744x","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/376x/Al_Fahid_Island_Abu_Dhabi_Area_Guide_Provident_Estate_ac5105f2db.webp","transform":"376x","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/340x212/Al_Fahid_Island_Abu_Dhabi_Area_Guide_Provident_Estate_ac5105f2db.webp","transform":"340x212","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/304x300/Al_Fahid_Island_Abu_Dhabi_Area_Guide_Provident_Estate_ac5105f2db.webp","transform":"304x300","format":"webp"}]},{"src_cftle":"i/Al_Fahid_Island_Abu_Dhabi_Area_Guide_4e3a165586.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/340x212/Al_Fahid_Island_Abu_Dhabi_Area_Guide_4e3a165586.webp","transform":"340x212","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/1773x/Al_Fahid_Island_Abu_Dhabi_Area_Guide_4e3a165586.webp","transform":"1773x","format":"webp"}]}],"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Al_Fahid_Island_Abu_Dhabi_Area_Guide_4e3a165586.jpg"},"seo":{"id":"821ca9c1-d0df-593b-a984-2fe23e9fbd0a","canonicalURL":null,"metaDescription":"Al Fahid Island blends mangrove beauty, smart design, and luxury living—perfectly positioned between Yas and Saadiyat Islands in Abu Dhabi.","metaTitle":"Al Fahid Island Abu Dhabi Area Guide","strapi_id":1836}},"off_plans":{"nodes":[{"status":"pending","createdAt":"2024-04-16T09:13:19.673Z","min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":5,"display_address":"Al Fahid Island","display_bedrooms":null,"developer":"Aldar Properties","completion_year":"2029","id":"f2d0a103-5be9-580a-bfc8-577f265e7818","published_date":"2025-06-02T06:23:43.983Z","building_type":["apartment","townhouse","p